{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2023-02-06 13:28:00', 'title': 'VINFAST CHOOSES U.S. BANK AS PREFERRED PROVIDER OF VEHICLE FINANCING AND LEASING IN THE UNITED STATES', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES , FEB. 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- VINFAST TODAY ANNOUNCED U.S. BANK (NYSE: USB) HAS BEEN CHOSEN AS ITS PREFERRED PROVIDER OF RETAIL FINANCING AND LEASING OF VINFAST VEHICLES IN THE UNITED STATES. U.S. BANK IS A TRUSTED LENDER FOR VEHICLE FINANCE AND LEASING, SERVING MILLIONS OF CUSTOMERS THROUGH CONSUMER AND BUSINESS BANKING, PAYMENT SERVICES, CORPORATE AND COMMERCIAL BANKING AND WEALTH MANAGEMENT AND INVESTMENT SERVICES.'}